      "start_seconds": 0.95,
      "end_seconds": 4.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "morning, come on through where shall we begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.15,
      "end_seconds": 13.21,
      "duration_seconds": 7.06,
      "text": "okay, so honestly, it's agitation, and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.8,
      "end_seconds": 17.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "how long has this been bothering you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.31,
      "end_seconds": 20.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "About... well, ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.22,
      "end_seconds": 39.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any recent infection or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.7,
      "end_seconds": 44.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "no, uh, none that I've noticed"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.56,
      "end_seconds": 48.54,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.56,
      "end_seconds": 52.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 54.3,
      "end_seconds": 55.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Neurologically, anything strange?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.67,
      "end_seconds": 58.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "no weakness or anything"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.91,
      "end_seconds": 62.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "Any regular medication, tablets or creams?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.24,
      "end_seconds": 70.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "No, nothing at the moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.41,
      "end_seconds": 76.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "let's talk a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.13,
      "end_seconds": 94.01,
      "duration_seconds": 16.88,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal. I smoke roughly a pack every two days. I grab fast food at lunch most days. I live with my elderly mother. I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.65,
      "end_seconds": 97.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.03,
      "end_seconds": 100.38,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.31,
      "end_seconds": 106.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "yes, eczema is known to us, good to have that clear"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.62,
      "end_seconds": 123.18,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.05,
      "end_seconds": 129.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "No not at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.94,
      "end_seconds": 136.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "let me ask about allergies, anything at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.9,
      "end_seconds": 141.03,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "uh, no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.91,
      "end_seconds": 144.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.66,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.16,
      "end_seconds": 157.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 166.76,
      "end_seconds": 181.8,
      "duration_seconds": 15.04,
      "text": "okay: blood pressure 124 over 77, weight 62 kilos, temperature 39.2. And height 164 centimetres, pulse is 93 beats a minute, saturation 96 percent, BMI works out to 23.1."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.96,
      "end_seconds": 186.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "Now I'm going to do a short physical check"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 188.03,
      "end_seconds": 190.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "raise your arm for me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.16,
      "end_seconds": 210.76,
      "duration_seconds": 6.6,
      "text": "You are hot shaking and your pulse is over one hundred and forty and irregular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.89,
      "end_seconds": 217.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "That's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.38,
      "end_seconds": 247.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.84,
      "text": "from what you've told me and what I found, I don't have a clear answer today: a thyroid storm is possible, and so is sepsis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.01,
      "end_seconds": 259.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "I think an ECG makes sense here for fast heart rhythm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.01,
      "end_seconds": 262.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.56,
      "text": "does it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.33,
      "end_seconds": 270.67,
      "duration_seconds": 7.34,
      "text": "the treatment will be propranolol, 1 milligrams, now, single dose that should help with thyroid storm"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.01,
      "end_seconds": 276.71,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Actually, should I carry on if I feel better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.66,
      "end_seconds": 284.08,
      "duration_seconds": 6.42,
      "text": "this is an emergency, you will be treated in high dependency. Let's review you straight away"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 285.54,
      "end_seconds": 288.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "I'll note it in my calendar"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 289.82,
      "end_seconds": 294.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "what are the next steps as you understand them?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 295.24,
      "end_seconds": 304.01,
      "duration_seconds": 8.77,
      "text": "So, I take the propranolol, 1 milligrams, now and come back straight away. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.59,
      "end_seconds": 309.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.0,
      "text": "okay, yes, exactly right anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 310.16,
      "end_seconds": 311.7,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "that's clear thanks"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.86,
      "end_seconds": 318.06,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "See you soon."
    }
  ]
